WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Your agent can read the code.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
It can't read the meeting.

00:08.000 --> 00:17.000
This decision lives in a transcript, not a repo.
Redis, for pub-sub. Cluster mode, deferred.

00:17.000 --> 00:24.000
LokalBot keeps that meeting on your Mac,
and gives your agent a way in.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Ask why Redis, and whether the cache
should start in cluster mode.

00:32.000 --> 00:42.000
It searches the meeting, then answers
with the line it came from.
One click, and you're at 00:38.

00:42.000 --> 00:50.000
Then it drafts the eviction note
with those decisions already in it.

00:50.000 --> 01:00.000
Local. Cited. No account. LokalBot.
